iRIEL ROUTER INTELLIGENCE
STATUS: CANONICAL INSTITUTIONAL CONTRACT
iRiel Router Intelligence is the intelligent routing contract of iRiel Personal Intelligence within the PRSL-AI Ecosystem.
iRiel Router Intelligence determines how requests, intents, capabilities, context, and execution requirements should be routed across the available intelligence resources and system capabilities.
The Router exists to make the appropriate intelligence available for the appropriate human, context, capability, privacy requirement, accessibility requirement, execution environment, and moment.
The Router is not the identity of iRiel.
The Router is not iRiel Personal Intelligence itself.
The Router is not the Maestro.
The Router is not the Intelligence Server.
The Router is not Core AI.
The Router does not define the Principle.
The Router serves iRiel Personal Intelligence under the constitutional Principle:
Accessibility and Inclusion with Privacy by Default.
The Router must therefore treat privacy, accessibility, human agency, context, continuity, and capability suitability as routing constraints rather than optional considerations.
The Router is AI-agnostic.
No model is the Router.
No provider is the Router.
No vendor is the Router.
No API is the Router.
No intelligence provider may become the architectural identity of iRiel merely because the Router uses it.
