The Router must remain capable of operating as the available intelligence landscape changes.
A provider may be added.
A provider may be removed.
A model may be upgraded.
A model may be deprecated.
A service may become unavailable.
A device may become unavailable.
The Router must adapt without changing the identity of iRiel Personal Intelligence.
The Router’s fundamental responsibility is not to select the most powerful intelligence.
It is to select the most appropriate intelligence.
Appropriateness is determined by the relevant context and applicable constraints.
